{"task_id": "Mbpp/80", "solution": "class TetrahedralNumber:\n    \"\"\"Value object encapsulating n and computed value.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, n: int, value: int):\n        self._n = n\n        self._value = value\n    def getValue(self) -> int:\n        return self._value\n\nclass InputValidator:\n    \"\"\"Encapsulates input validation logic for n (ensure n is integer >= 1).\"\"\"\n    def is_valid(self, n: int) -> bool:\n        return isinstance(n, int) and n >= 1\n\nclass TetrahedralCalculator:\n    \"\"\"Computes nth tetrahedral number.\"\"\"\n    def tetrahedral_number(self, n: int) -> int:\n        return self.compute(n)\n    def compute(self, n: int) -> int:\n        value = (n * (n + 1) * (n + 2)) // 6\n        return int(value)\n\ndef tetrahedral_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Public API function. Validates n using InputValidator and returns computed int value from TetrahedralCalculator.\"\"\"\n    validator = InputValidator()\n    if not validator.is_valid(n):\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be an integer >= 1\")\n    calc = TetrahedralCalculator()\n    return calc.compute(n)"}
